# RAG Evaluation Plan: Baseline Chunking, Retrieval Precision & Answer Grounding

## 📌 Context & Objective
Evaluating the baseline retrieval performance, chunk granularity, and answer grounding of the RAG pipeline on **`Documents/The Comedy of Errors document.pdf`** using topic-focused questions before performing chunker tuning.

